DESCRIPTION:Lawrence Killebrew is a nationally touring stand-up comedian\, 
 actor\, and host whose comedy is built on personal experiences\, sharp obse
 rvations\, and relatable storytelling.\n\nOriginally from Philadelphia and 
 now based in Atlanta\, Lawrence has spent years performing for audiences ac
 ross the country\, developing a style that connects with everyone from come
 dy club regulars to first-time comedy fans.\n\nHis television credits inclu
 de Comedy Central's Hart of the City and TV One's Family Time. In addition 
 to stand-up\, Lawrence has been featured on radio\, hosted live events\, an
 d built a loyal audience through his consistent touring schedule and engagi
 ng social media presence.\n\nWhether performing as a headliner\, feature ac
 t\, or host\, Lawrence brings professionalism\, strong crowd interaction\, 
 and a memorable performance to every stage.\n\nPlease note\, there is a 2 i
 tem per person minimum in the showroom. This can be any combination of food
  items or beverages. This does NOT include items bought in the basement at 
